From dc5ebc8d04dd24012f1938a5748c19edfb2e79fa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Tomasi <ricardobeat@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 04:35:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add C hot-path VM dispatch with 39% arithmetic speedup
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Extract hot opcodes (ADD, SUB, MUL, COMPARE, JUMP, IF) into a C
dispatch function (vm_dispatch_hot_run) to avoid C3 switch overhead.
Fix sign extension bug in get_fastint() that caused infinite loops
on negative fastints — cast must occur between the two shifts to
enable arithmetic right shift.

